<p>You drink deeper from the timeline of others. Each time you apply atrophy you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.7%, 1.1%, 1.3%, 1.5%, 1.8%</acronym> spell speed per atrophy stack on the target and cause them to lose <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1%, 3%, 4%, 5%, 5%</acronym> of a turn.</p><p>The highest atrophy stack found will be used for the spell speed calculation.</p>